1
00:00:01,430 --> 00:00:03,130
This is pretty much what's happened so far.
到目前為止大概是這樣子…

2
00:00:04,170 --> 00:00:06,370
Ross was in love with Rachel since forever.
打從一開始羅斯就愛瑞秋

3
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:10,110
Every time he tried to tell her, something got in the way...
但每次他想要表白 總是會遇上阻礙…

4
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:12,510
...Iike cats,Italian guys.
像是貓咪，意大利佬

5
00:00:13,150 --> 00:00:15,590
And finally,Chandler was, like,"Forget about her."
最後錢德勸他死心

6
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:20,260
When Ross was in China,Chandler let it slip that Ross loved Rachel.
羅斯去中國考古時 錢德說漏嘴羅斯愛瑞秋

7
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:22,760
She was,like,"Oh,my God!"
瑞秋非常驚訝

8
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:25,330
So she went to the airport to meet him.
於是她到機場接羅斯

9
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:29,870
She didn 't know Ross was getting off the plane with another woman.
她不知道羅斯 帶了另一個女人下飛機

10
00:00:31,170 --> 00:00:33,540
That's pretty much everything you need to know.
大概就是這樣子了

11
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:35,970
But enough about us. How have you been?
說夠了我們，你們近來如何？

12
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:40,500
The One With Ross' New Girlfriend
六人行 第2季 第01集 羅斯的新女友

13
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:23,730
Flight number 457 from Beijing now arriving.
從北京飛來第457號班機 已經降落

14
00:01:31,310 --> 00:01:32,070
Oh,my God!
我的天啊！

15
00:01:33,140 --> 00:01:34,140
Oh,my God!
天啊！

16
00:01:34,510 --> 00:01:35,180
Excuse me.
對不起

17
00:01:35,450 --> 00:01:37,750
Move,move,move! Emergency,please!
借過，借過！ 緊急事件，拜託！

18
00:01:38,150 --> 00:01:39,720
Excuse me,excuse me.
對不起，對不起

19
00:01:48,530 --> 00:01:49,760
There you are!
原來你們在那裡！

20
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:54,770
So,so....
所以，所以…

21
00:01:55,270 --> 00:01:57,340
How was China? You!
中國怎麼樣？老兄！

22
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:00,410
It was great.
很棒…

23
00:02:01,110 --> 00:02:02,040
What happened?
你怎麼啦？

24
00:02:02,410 --> 00:02:03,680
-You're bleeding. -I am?
你在流血 是嗎？

25
00:02:04,180 --> 00:02:05,750
Oh,look at that! Yes,I am.
啊，怪怪！我是在流血

26
00:02:06,180 --> 00:02:08,420
Enough about me, Mr. Back From The Orient!
別管我了 周遊東方的旅人！

27
00:02:09,150 --> 00:02:12,190
Come on,I wanna hear everything! Everything!
我要聽一切事情！ 什麼都不要漏掉！

28
00:02:14,260 --> 00:02:15,860
Well,where do I start?
嗯，要從何開始？

29
00:02:17,390 --> 00:02:19,430
This is Julie. Julie,this is Rachel.
這位是茱莉 茱莉，這位是瑞秋

30
00:02:25,430 --> 00:02:26,130
These are....
這些…

31
00:02:27,270 --> 00:02:28,470
...aren't for you.
…不是要給你的

32
00:02:30,410 --> 00:02:31,440
These are for you.
這些是要送給你的

33
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:34,180
Welcome to our country.
歡迎光臨敝國

34
00:02:37,450 --> 00:02:39,250
Thank you. I'm from New York.
謝謝，我是紐約人

35
00:02:43,490 --> 00:02:45,990
No problem. We'll use them to stop the bleeding.
沒關係，我用它來止血

36
00:02:50,030 --> 00:02:50,900
Baggage claim?
去拿行李？

37
00:02:57,470 --> 00:03:00,640
I'm telling U.She went to the airport, and she's gonna go for it with Ross.
她去了機場 準備跟羅斯坦白了

38
00:03:01,310 --> 00:03:03,110
Oh,my God! This is huge!
天啊！這是大事！

39
00:03:06,480 --> 00:03:08,280
This is bigger than huge. This is....
這比大事還大 這是…

40
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:10,020
All right,what's bigger than huge?
什麼比大事還大？

41
00:03:12,190 --> 00:03:12,790
This?
這件事嗎？

42
00:03:15,190 --> 00:03:16,490
Guys,you got new haircuts!
喂，你們剪頭髮了！

43
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:19,800
Yes,we did. Thanks to Vidal Buffay.
是的，謝謝布菲美發大師

44
00:03:21,130 --> 00:03:23,770
Because,you know,"lf you don't look good,we don't look good."
因為如果你們丟臉 我們也丟臉（廣告詞）

45
00:03:24,370 --> 00:03:25,600
I love that voice!
我喜歡這聲音！

46
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:30,810
And the winner is Eva Godna!

47
00:03:32,980 --> 00:03:35,710
Airport. Airport. Ross.
機場…機場…羅斯

48
00:03:36,450 --> 00:03:37,450
Not alone.
不是一個人

49
00:03:39,150 --> 00:03:39,820
Julie.
茱莉

50
00:03:41,250 --> 00:03:42,290
Arm around her!
摟著她！

51
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:45,260
Cramp! Cramp! Cramp!
抽筋！抽筋！

52
00:03:46,290 --> 00:03:48,090
I think she's trying to tell us something.
她好像想說什麼

53
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:50,330
Quick,get the verbs.
趕快猜動詞

54
00:03:52,430 --> 00:03:53,400
You! You!
你！你！

55
00:03:54,230 --> 00:03:55,700
You said he liked me!
你說他喜歡我！

56
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:57,040
You!
你！

57
00:03:57,670 --> 00:03:59,340
You slowpokes!
你這個慢郎中！

58
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:02,110
That's all right. We got the bags.
沒關係，我們拿了行李

59
00:04:06,110 --> 00:04:07,410
This is my sister,Monica.
這是我妹妹摩妮卡

60
00:04:09,250 --> 00:04:09,950
This is Chandler.
這是錢德

61
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:10,950
Phoebe,hi.
菲比，嗨

62
00:04:11,290 --> 00:04:11,850
Joey.
喬伊

63
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:15,690
Everyone,this is Julie.
各位，這位是茱莉

64
00:04:16,290 --> 00:04:16,860
Julie.
茱莉

65
00:04:23,100 --> 00:04:24,700
But I'm not here, you haven't met me.
但我還沒到 我們還沒見面

66
00:04:25,170 --> 00:04:28,340
I'll make a better impression when I don't have 20 hours of plane on me.
沒有連坐二十小時飛機 明天我會讓各位刮目相看

67
00:04:30,210 --> 00:04:31,340
-And bus. -Oh,my God!
還有巴士 喔，天啊！

68
00:04:32,410 --> 00:04:33,710
-With the screaming guy -And the spitting.
那個尖叫的傢伙… 還有吐口水

69
00:04:34,210 --> 00:04:35,380
You gotta hear this story.
你們一定要聽這個故事

70
00:04:36,210 --> 00:04:38,150
We're on this bus that's 200 years old.
我們坐的巴士一定有兩百年舊

71
00:04:39,250 --> 00:04:39,950
Two hundred,at least.
至少兩百年舊

72
00:04:40,420 --> 00:04:41,920
And the chicken poops in her lap!
一隻雞拉屎在她腿上！

73
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,160
I'm so sorry.
對不起

74
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,660
I just gave away the ending,didn't l?
我說出了結尾，對不對？

75
00:04:54,330 --> 00:04:59,200
I just heard this story in the cab... and it is all I can think about.
我在計程車上聽了這個故事… 滿腦子想的都是這個

76
00:05:02,410 --> 00:05:03,410
This is amazing.
真是驚人

77
00:05:05,210 --> 00:05:06,210
How did this happen?
怎麼發生的？

78
00:05:07,410 --> 00:05:08,550
We were in grad school together.
羅斯與我一起上過研究所

79
00:05:08,810 --> 00:05:11,280
We haven't seen each other since then. I land in China...
後來就沒有再見面 我降落在中國機場時…

80
00:05:12,420 --> 00:05:13,850
...guess who's in charge of the dig?
…猜猜是誰負責探勘？

81
00:05:14,420 --> 00:05:15,090
Julie!
就是茱莉！

82
00:05:17,390 --> 00:05:18,220
Isn't that great?
真是太棒了！

83
00:05:19,260 --> 00:05:22,360
Isn't that just kick-you-in-the-crotch, spit-on-your-neck fantastic?
真是棒得面紅耳赤！ 棒得有苦說不出！

84
00:05:25,500 --> 00:05:26,300
It's an expression.
她習慣這麼說

85
00:05:28,570 --> 00:05:30,000
We just wanted to say a quick hi.
我們只是來打個招呼

86
00:05:31,140 --> 00:05:32,810
-Then we'll see the baby. -Then get some sleep.
然後我們要去看寶寶 然後睡一下覺

87
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,780
It's 6:00 tomorrow night,our time.
現在是中國的明天晚上六點

88
00:05:36,410 --> 00:05:38,450
Don't tell us what's gonna happen. I like being surprised.
別告訴我會發生什麼事 我比較喜歡驚喜

89
00:05:44,420 --> 00:05:45,020
Bye!
再見！

90
00:05:57,510 --> 00:05:58,980
-Can I get some coffee? -Sure.
瑞秋，我想喝點咖啡 沒問題

91
00:06:00,380 --> 00:06:01,550
-Did you talk to him yet? -No.
你跟他談了嗎？ 沒有

92
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:02,820
Then,no.
沒咖啡給你

93
00:06:15,440 --> 00:06:17,140
What the hell happened to you in China?
你在中國發生了什麼事？

94
00:06:18,340 --> 00:06:20,810
When last we left you, you were in love with,you know.
你離開前還瘋狂愛著… 你知道的

95
00:06:22,210 --> 00:06:22,880
I know I was.
我知道我愛她

96
00:06:23,380 --> 00:06:25,580
But there was always this voice inside that kept saying:
但我心中有這個小聲音告訴我

97
00:06:26,250 --> 00:06:29,250
"It's never gonna happen. Move on." You know whose voice that was?
不可能成功的，死心吧 你知道那是誰的聲音嗎？

98
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:32,160
God?
上帝？

99
00:06:33,390 --> 00:06:34,460
It was you,pal.
是你的聲音，老哥

100
00:06:36,430 --> 00:06:37,630
Maybe it was God doing me.
也許是上帝模仿我的聲音

101
00:06:44,300 --> 00:06:47,140
You were right. She looks at me and sees a friend. That's all.
你說得對 她眼中只把我當成朋友

102
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:49,740
And then I met Julie...
然後我遇見了茱莉

103
00:06:51,110 --> 00:06:52,610
...and we're having a great time.
我們在一起非常開心

104
00:06:53,410 --> 00:06:55,850
I never would have gone for it, if it hadn't been for you.
要不是因為你 我絕不會跟茱莉在一起

105
00:06:58,620 --> 00:07:00,450
Well,you owe me one,big guy.
你欠我一個情，大個兒

106
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:03,160
Your lemonade.
你的檸檬汁

107
00:07:03,590 --> 00:07:04,390
I didn't order it.
我沒有叫檸檬汁

108
00:07:06,460 --> 00:07:08,430
Then go take that back. They'll charge you for that.
那你最好送回去 否則他們會要你付錢！

109
00:07:09,260 --> 00:07:10,860
Go,go,go! Come on,come on!
快！快！快去！

110
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:15,570
So what did you find out?
你問出了什麼？

111
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:17,300
He said....
他說…

112
00:07:18,210 --> 00:07:19,270
He said....
他說…

113
00:07:23,310 --> 00:07:24,680
They're having a great time.
他們在一起很開心

114
00:07:25,650 --> 00:07:26,650
I'm sorry.
對不起

115
00:07:28,220 --> 00:07:30,350
But the silver lining, if you wanna see it...
但有好的一面 如果你願意這麼看…

116
00:07:31,290 --> 00:07:33,520
...is that he made this decision all by himself...
他完全是自己做了這個決定

117
00:07:34,220 --> 00:07:36,660
...without any outside help whatsoever.
完全沒有受外人的影響

118
00:07:38,530 --> 00:07:40,260
How is that a silver lining?
這怎麼是好的一面？

119
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:43,100
You have to really wanna see it.
你要非常願意才看得出來

120
00:07:49,540 --> 00:07:51,770
Ironically,these guys were picked last in gym.
諷刺的是這些傢伙 上體育課時沒人願意跟他一隊

121
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:54,180
Hey,Pheebs.
菲比

122
00:07:55,710 --> 00:07:57,010
You know what I'm thinking?
你知道我想什麼嗎？

123
00:08:03,420 --> 00:08:04,020
How...
因為…

124
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:06,490
...it's been so long since you've had sex...
你太久沒做愛了…

125
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,990
...you're wondering if they've changed it?
你不知道有沒有什麼改變？

126
00:08:13,330 --> 00:08:16,230
No. Although now that's what I'm thinking.
不是 但是我現在是這麼想了

127
00:08:19,400 --> 00:08:20,570
So what were you thinking?
你本來在想什麼？

128
00:08:21,140 --> 00:08:24,110
You gave the guys great haircuts. I thought you'd like to do mine.
你幫他們剪頭髮 我想你也應該幫我剪

129
00:08:26,210 --> 00:08:26,710
No.
不要

130
00:08:28,150 --> 00:08:28,780
Why not?
為什麼不要？

131
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:30,480
Because I'm just....
因為我是個…

132
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:33,850
I'm incredibly anal and an unbelievable control freak.
我非常挑剔 而且有控制狂

133
00:08:34,350 --> 00:08:35,120
No,you're not.
不，你才不是

134
00:08:36,490 --> 00:08:38,260
I know I'm not,but you are.
我知道我不是 不過你是

135
00:08:39,160 --> 00:08:41,290
I was trying to spare your feelings.
我只是不想傷害你的心

136
00:08:44,300 --> 00:08:44,930
Hold on.
請等一下

137
00:08:46,260 --> 00:08:47,730
Ross,Julie for you.
羅斯，茱莉找你

138
00:08:57,140 --> 00:08:58,480
Anybody know a good tailor?
誰能介紹一個好裁縫？

139
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:21,570
You need clothes altered?
需要改衣服嗎？

140
00:09:22,170 --> 00:09:24,540
No,I'm just looking for a man to draw on me with chalk.
不，我只是要找一個人 用粉筆在我身上畫線

141
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:28,480
Go see Frankie. My family's been going to him forever.
去找法蘭基 我家人都找他做衣服

142
00:09:29,210 --> 00:09:31,010
He did my first suit when I was 1 5.
我十五歲第一套西裝 就是他做的

143
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:33,580
No,wait,1 6.
不，十六歲

144
00:09:34,380 --> 00:09:36,990
No,excuse me,1 5.
不，對不起，是十五歲

145
09:39,120 --> 09:40,690
All right,when was 1 990?
1990年是幾歲？

146
00:09:44,230 --> 00:09:46,560
You have to stop the Q-Tip when there's resistance!
當你掏耳朵時 碰到東西就要停下來！

147
00:09:56,110 --> 00:09:57,640
Sweetheart,I'll see you later.
甜心，待會見

148
00:09:58,210 --> 00:09:59,110
Okay,bye.
好，再見

149
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,880
That is so sweet.
你真好

150
00:10:08,420 --> 00:10:09,820
Okay. No,you hang up.
好，不，你先掛

151
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,190
No,you
不，你先…

152
00:10:13,560 --> 00:10:15,360
One,two,three.
一，二，三

153
00:10:18,460 --> 00:10:19,600
You didn't hang up either.
你也沒有掛

154
00:10:20,330 --> 00:10:21,700
She didn't hang up.
她沒掛

155
00:10:28,210 --> 00:10:29,210
No,you hang up.
不，你掛電話

156
00:10:29,640 --> 00:10:30,940
You. You.
你掛，你掛

157
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:42,220
Sorry,I thought you were talking to me.
對不起，我以為你在跟我說話

158
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,190
Rachel.
瑞秋！

159
00:10:46,420 --> 00:10:47,790
I'll just call her back.
我打回去

160
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:52,200
Hi,sweetie. I'm sorry. We got disconnected.
嗨，甜心，對不起 我們被中斷了

161
00:10:54,770 --> 00:10:56,000
How did this happen to me?
我到底是怎麼回事？

162
00:10:56,370 --> 00:10:58,570
A week ago,two weeks ago,I was fine.
一周前，兩周前，我很好

163
00:11:00,410 --> 00:11:01,980
Ross was just Ross. Just this guy.
羅斯只是羅斯 這是這個傢伙

164
00:11:02,510 --> 00:11:04,910
Now all of a sudden,he's Ross...
現在突然間，他不一樣了

165
00:11:07,180 --> 00:11:09,420
...this really great guy that I can't have.
變成這個大帥哥 我卻無法得到

166
00:11:11,390 --> 00:11:13,090
Sweetie,I wanted you to have him too.
甜心，我也希望你能得到他

167
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:14,790
I know you did.
我知道你的心意

168
00:11:19,660 --> 00:11:21,430
I'm just gonna deal with it.
我必須要想辦法

169
00:11:25,470 --> 00:11:27,510
I gotta get out of here!
我必須要離開這裡！

170
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:32,950
I don't care what you guys say, something's bothering her.
我不管你們怎麼說 她有心事

171
00:11:39,390 --> 00:11:41,490
You know,I think I was 1 6.
我想我是十六歲

172
00:11:48,530 --> 00:11:50,060
Please,just a little bit off the back.
求求你，只要剪後面一點點

173
00:11:51,330 --> 00:11:52,370
I'm still on "no."
我還是堅持不要

174
00:11:54,570 --> 00:11:55,270
Morning.
早安

175
00:11:56,340 --> 00:11:58,110
Could you close your eyes for a sec?
你們能不能閉上眼睛一秒鐘？

176
00:11:59,340 --> 00:12:01,710
No,no,no. I'm not falling for that again.
不，不，不 我可不要再上當

177
00:12:04,380 --> 00:12:05,250
What's going on?
怎麼回事？

178
00:12:05,620 --> 00:12:07,150
I sort of did a stupid thing last night.
昨晚我做了一件蠢事

179
00:12:07,450 --> 00:12:08,890
What stupid thing did you do?
你做了什麼蠢事？

